/DATA/processed_data/**/工程数据/previews/

# Frame sequences are local rendering inputs; retain case HTML and final posters.
/视频/成功案例可视化/**/frame_*.png
/视频/成功案例可视化/**/start_overview.png
/视频/实际用途示意/frame_*.png

